ggvmap: copyright notices for third-party code
==============================================

The layout loop in R/voronoi_map.R (.vmap_solve, .flickering_ratio,
.handle_overweighted) and the first phase of R/vmap_region.R
(.region_solve) are R ports of the iteration heuristics of the JavaScript
library d3-voronoi-map by Franck Lebeau
(https://github.com/Kcnarf/d3-voronoi-map): position adaptation damped by a
"flickering" ratio (influence 0.5), weight adaptation clamped to
[0.9, 1.1] and damped by the same ratio (influence 0.1), the
over-weighted-site correction, and the defaults convergence ratio 0.01 and
minimum weight ratio 0.01. d3-voronoi-map itself implements the algorithm
of Nocaj & Brandes (2012). The original licence follows.

